WEBVTT

00:09.360 --> 00:12.200
The late evening sun gleaming through the windows, after the school's last bell,

00:12.200 --> 00:16.450
with two people on the verge of breaking every rule possible...

00:15.030 --> 00:15.780
Sensei,

00:15.030 --> 00:15.780
I'll wait

00:15.030 --> 00:15.780
in the

00:15.030 --> 00:15.780
classroom,

00:15.030 --> 00:15.780
school.

00:17.330 --> 00:23.920
Rational, common sense, and God Himself, had left his reasonings to his own.

00:25.750 --> 00:31.460
His only thoughts were to plunge his newborn snake

00:31.460 --> 00:35.180
deep into the slick, young underbrush.

00:35.180 --> 00:38.470
Those thoughts alone commanded him.

00:46.060 --> 00:48.860
My heart throbs as I really do love you!

00:57.410 --> 01:02.250
These fifteen secrets in my head are written in letters, tucked away in my uniform.

01:02.450 --> 01:08.040
When you keep on making circles around me, in the middle of the launch of your image,

01:08.880 --> 01:13.590
you treat me kindly even with your mean look and puffed cheeks.

01:13.590 --> 01:19.260
For your first heart-throbbing, I'm sure you'll find it tremendous!

01:19.800 --> 01:22.720
Your voice will escape daringly!

01:22.720 --> 01:25.600
What you want to make your heart tingle, tell me!

01:25.600 --> 01:28.520
Quick! Let me! Where do you want what?! Seriously, you're terrible!

01:28.520 --> 01:30.520
These wild ideas have all detonated!

01:30.520 --> 01:33.360
I want to try and swallow more

01:33.360 --> 01:36.530
I want you to pet me more

01:36.530 --> 01:39.370
What kind of flavor is your heart?

01:39.370 --> 01:42.240
Someday, I'll be sure to grasp a hold of what's real

01:42.240 --> 01:44.540
I want to embrace you more

01:44.540 --> 01:47.750
Will you secretly let me see you?

01:47.790 --> 01:50.630
I can't get enough of this dream I'm having!

01:50.630 --> 01:56.010
Be it my heart or also my body, I'll hand them over since it's you.

01:53.840 --> 01:58.590
My heart throbs as I really do love you! (Look here!)

02:18.320 --> 02:23.330
"Welcome to Inspiration Academy!"

02:23.200 --> 02:24.700
<i>A dream?</i>

02:28.500 --> 02:30.370
Working?

02:30.370 --> 02:32.750
Or are you fantasizing again?

02:32.750 --> 02:36.300
Try and keep your mouth zipped when having your delusions next time, okay?

02:36.300 --> 02:38.800
No one wants to hear your thoughts,

02:38.800 --> 02:40.380
Akutagawa Taketo-kun.

02:41.550 --> 02:42.890
R-Right.

02:42.890 --> 02:44.640
Excellent!

02:44.640 --> 02:48.060
And there he goes again.

02:54.270 --> 02:57.530
Splendid! He's like a beast,
overjoyed by springs onset!

02:57.530 --> 02:59.900
A spring beast!

03:01.240 --> 03:02.160
Taketo.

03:02.160 --> 03:07.040
Your thoughts just never seem
to make any sense.

03:09.040 --> 03:11.370
<i>Jeez... not again.</i>

03:15.290 --> 03:17.130
<i>Narukara-san...</i>

03:17.510 --> 03:18.840
U-Um...

03:18.840 --> 03:23.430
Sensei! He's still acting just as bad...

03:26.100 --> 03:27.390
<i>Aw, man...</i>

03:29.270 --> 03:31.480
<i>No, no. Calm down.</i>

03:31.480 --> 03:34.520
<i>This is still a thousand times
better than middle school!</i>

03:35.440 --> 03:40.650
<i>Ever since I revealed myself as the masked
porno author, pen named Akutagawa Taketo, </i>

03:40.650 --> 03:43.490
<i>no matter where I went,</i>

03:43.490 --> 03:46.450
<i>people talked about me.
Behind my back and to my face.</i>

03:46.450 --> 03:50.040
<i>Girls would cry, just because
I was in their class.</i>

03:50.040 --> 03:53.460
<i>And I was called every kind of
awful name imaginable. </i>

03:53.460 --> 03:56.250
<i>Every day was hell.</i>

03:58.800 --> 04:00.260
<i>But now,</i>

04:00.260 --> 04:05.390
<i>the reason I can enjoy even the semblance
of a high school life</i>

04:05.390 --> 04:06.890
<i>is because of...</i>

04:07.760 --> 04:11.140
Inspiration Academy Private High School.

04:11.850 --> 04:17.480
A sacred place of learning, for genius
students chosen from across Japan.

04:17.480 --> 04:18.650
Sparkling creativity.

04:18.650 --> 04:20.360
Minds and bodies in motion.

04:20.360 --> 04:22.610
Spirits, as free as the wind.

04:22.610 --> 04:25.320
The possibilities are truly limitless.

04:25.320 --> 04:27.740
Decency, common sense, and ethics.

04:27.740 --> 04:29.910
None of the rules that apply
in the rest of the world,

04:29.910 --> 04:33.870
can stem the tide of
their overflowing genius.

04:33.870 --> 04:39.130
Because every boy and girl
here is a true genius!

04:39.630 --> 04:45.050
These are the words of Kuroki Suiboku—founder,
principal, and school chairman,

04:45.050 --> 04:50.260
"Genius is 1% inspiration
and 99% perspiration!"

04:50.680 --> 04:51.560
In other words,

04:51.560 --> 04:54.690
believe in your inspiration,
and fight to the end!

04:55.440 --> 04:59.230
Perspiration, without
inspiration, is wasted!

05:00.320 --> 05:02.530
No matter what others say,

05:02.530 --> 05:03.780
ignore them!

05:06.200 --> 05:08.570
This is the Inspiration Academy's motto,

05:08.570 --> 05:13.830
"Trust your inspiration! Trust your talent!
Follow your own path!"

05:13.830 --> 05:16.830
Glory to Inspiration Academy!

05:16.830 --> 05:20.090
This is Kiya Star, narrating!

05:24.630 --> 05:26.220
She's a genius.

05:28.390 --> 05:31.600
<i>But sometimes geniuses do
make mistakes, too.</i>

05:35.940 --> 05:37.310
Listen, Taketo.

05:37.900 --> 05:40.560
I'm your classmate and friend.

05:40.560 --> 05:45.240
I'd like to think that I'm making a
real attempt to understand your talent.

05:45.240 --> 05:50.450
But given that female students don't understand
and continue to misunderstand you...

05:50.450 --> 05:52.240
It's, well...

05:52.240 --> 05:53.830
I can't bear to watch it.

05:53.830 --> 05:55.660
To be honest,

05:55.660 --> 05:57.750
you're too wide-open!

05:58.210 --> 05:59.500
Taketo?

05:59.500 --> 06:01.250
Are you listening?

06:01.250 --> 06:03.250
<i>No one understands.</i>

06:03.750 --> 06:07.090
<i>Blinded by a superficial sense
of morality and disgust,</i>

06:07.090 --> 06:09.510
<i>they've lost sight of the truth.</i>

06:09.510 --> 06:11.010
<i>After all...</i>

06:12.850 --> 06:15.100
<i>sex lies at the core of human existence!</i>

06:15.100 --> 06:18.640
<i>Thus, to write about sex is to write
about what makes us truly human!</i>

06:18.640 --> 06:21.020
<i>Yes, that is the literature of which I pen!</i>

06:21.020 --> 06:27.070
<i>Using my prowess as a pornographic writer,
I shall someday reach the very heights of literature!</i>

06:29.280 --> 06:32.780
<i>And when my literature
touches the heart of mankind...</i>

06:32.780 --> 06:36.540
<i>No, on the day I carve
my name into literary history,</i>

06:34.490 --> 06:34.540
"Between Warmth and Wetness"

06:34.540 --> 06:34.580
by Akutagawa Taketo.

06:35.290 --> 06:35.330
Huge new print run!!

06:37.910 --> 06:39.670
<i>the world will change!</i>

06:39.670 --> 06:45.300
<i>When I triumph over those who mocked me,
it will be a day of glory!</i>

06:41.040 --> 06:42.250
Akutagawa Taketo Wins

06:41.040 --> 06:43.420
The Tokyo Governor's Prize

06:45.300 --> 06:47.590
<i>I'll live richly off the royalties!</i>

06:47.590 --> 06:49.720
<i>I'll have beautiful girls
and a sunny island,</i>

06:49.720 --> 06:51.800
<i>and I'll enjoy life in my palace of sin!</i>

06:55.760 --> 06:57.180
Hey, Taketo!

06:58.810 --> 07:00.690
Are you listening?

07:01.400 --> 07:03.190
Y-Your eyelashes are too long!

07:03.190 --> 07:05.110
I mean, I'm listening. I'm listening.

07:05.110 --> 07:09.360
Yeah, wide-open... that's it.
I'm too wide-open. I'd like to think that's it.

07:09.360 --> 07:10.240
I mean, I like you...

07:12.240 --> 07:14.870
Y-You like me?

07:14.870 --> 07:17.240
What are you talking about?

07:17.240 --> 07:20.250
I'm just your classmate.

07:20.250 --> 07:20.920
So...

07:21.870 --> 07:23.250
Ritsu?

07:23.750 --> 07:27.460
But I... I definitely don't, okay?

07:27.460 --> 07:31.130
Calm down, Ritsu!
Here, let me write this out again.

07:31.130 --> 07:32.130
What does this equal?

07:33.890 --> 07:40.770
3.141592653589793238462643...

07:40.770 --> 07:45.060
<i>He looks like he takes things seriously,
but he's actually really sincere and nice.</i>

07:45.060 --> 07:49.030
<i>But why does he
say nonsensical things sometimes?</i>

07:49.030 --> 07:51.280
Here you go, Onee-sama. Open up!

07:52.700 --> 07:54.320
How is it?

07:54.320 --> 07:56.580
It's good!

07:56.580 --> 08:00.910
Aa-chan, your ebi-fry is so delicious,
it echoes throughout the galaxy!

08:02.830 --> 08:05.580
<i>Come to think of it, Ritsu once said</i>

08:05.580 --> 08:06.590
<i>that Ran...</i>

08:13.220 --> 08:15.010
It's so sweet.

08:15.010 --> 08:17.180
Onee-sama, I'm embarrassed.

08:17.180 --> 08:19.600
Let's see how it tastes down here.

08:25.520 --> 08:31.030
<i>Well, I'm not the kind of guy to
complain about anyone else's tastes.</i>

08:31.030 --> 08:31.780
Ow!

08:31.780 --> 08:34.610
Stop looking at us! Creep!

08:35.200 --> 08:36.780
Hold on a second.

08:37.240 --> 08:41.250
It isn't like he said something.
There's no reason to behave that way.

08:41.250 --> 08:43.250
What did Taketo do to you?

08:43.250 --> 08:45.250
He looked at us! In a lewd way!

08:45.250 --> 08:47.040
I bet he was thinking of
perverted things again.

08:47.040 --> 08:50.750
And I don't think he has
the right to even use my name!

08:50.750 --> 08:52.880
So are you a psychic genius?

08:52.880 --> 08:56.550
If nothing else, I'd need a more
logical answer than that.

08:56.550 --> 08:57.470
What?

09:00.430 --> 09:03.770
<i>Ritsu, I'm grateful
for your friendship,</i>

09:03.770 --> 09:06.560
<i>but I actually was imagining
things. I'm sorry.</i>

09:24.330 --> 09:25.830
Ch-Chief!

09:25.830 --> 09:27.620
Chief of what?

09:27.620 --> 09:31.090
You don't know her?
She's the Newspaper Circle Chief.

09:31.090 --> 09:34.510
She's a first-rate genius,
even here at Inspiration Academy.

09:36.180 --> 09:40.050
Taketo-san, we've decided on the
front page, for next week's paper.

09:43.350 --> 09:47.810
"New Freshman Special!
Watch out for these geniuses!"

09:43.350 --> 09:51.360
New First-Years

09:43.350 --> 09:51.360
Featured Report!

09:43.350 --> 09:51.360
Take notice of

09:43.350 --> 09:51.360
