09:43.350 --> 09:51.360
First

09:43.350 --> 09:51.360
Section

09:43.350 --> 09:51.360
"The Clarinet Genius"

09:47.810 --> 09:51.360
"Part 1: Narukara Fukune,
Clarinet Genius."

09:51.360 --> 09:52.780
Fukune-chan?

09:52.780 --> 09:56.490
So the first one will be from our class?

09:56.490 --> 09:58.110
This'll be interesting.

09:58.110 --> 10:01.910
Um, Chief, I'm sorry.

10:01.910 --> 10:05.160
But I don't know if it's a good idea for me
