10:05.160 --> 10:07.080
Is there some problem?

10:07.080 --> 10:08.370
Um, well...

10:08.750 --> 10:11.460
Kind of... Sort of...

10:11.460 --> 10:12.290
Ow.

10:12.290 --> 10:14.760
Take care of it for me, okay?

10:16.010 --> 10:18.180
U-Um, Chief!

10:33.570 --> 10:36.440
She isn't in the classroom
nor in the music wing.

10:36.440 --> 10:39.820
And she's not back at
her dorm, which means...

10:42.700 --> 10:46.330
You really are looking for
her, Akutagawa Taketo.

10:46.330 --> 10:49.750
You're almost like a
stalker. Stalker boy.

10:49.750 --> 10:53.840
I can't help it! I have to interview her
for the Newspaper Circle.

10:53.840 --> 10:58.010
I guess with that as your excuse,
you can do whatever you want.

10:58.010 --> 10:59.840
Good for you, pervert.

10:59.840 --> 11:03.640
Why are you following me, anyway?

11:03.640 --> 11:05.850
You're not part of the Newspaper Circle.

11:07.850 --> 11:10.020
They want me to take some pictures.

11:10.020 --> 11:13.360
You didn't know that
much? EroEro-head-kun.

11:13.360 --> 11:16.570
Come on, show me what you really are.

11:16.570 --> 11:18.030
What I really am?

11:18.030 --> 11:20.650
I want a moment of ugliness and lust.

11:20.650 --> 11:24.450
In that moment, you can see
what humans really are.

11:25.280 --> 11:28.830
What's wrong? Come on, do it...

11:39.010 --> 11:41.260
Stop it, you stupid insect!

11:41.260 --> 11:42.840
I'm the camerawoman here!

11:42.840 --> 11:45.600
No, tonight we'll be
taking pictures of you.

11:48.720 --> 11:51.600
<i>I know who I'm making
as my personal page #1...</i>

11:53.100 --> 11:54.860
M-My eyes!

11:54.860 --> 11:58.320
That face was pretty
good, you centipede.

11:58.320 --> 12:00.610
Walking failure...

12:04.110 --> 12:10.450
"The man put his black-red madness
to her quivering honey pot.

12:10.450 --> 12:11.250
'Haan...'

12:11.250 --> 12:13.500
Pleasure juice overflowed.

12:13.500 --> 12:16.710
It was hotter than magma
and sweeter than cream,

12:16.710 --> 12:20.260
and yet, it had the bitterness of sin.

12:20.260 --> 12:22.380
And the camerawoman..."

12:22.380 --> 12:24.220
Hey, stop it! Don't read that!

12:24.970 --> 12:28.310
What? You were thinking about me?

12:28.310 --> 12:30.350
Well, keep it up.

12:30.350 --> 12:33.640
Don't miss a chance to let
your instincts go crazy.

12:35.940 --> 12:39.520
Why are you sitting there?
Hurry up, ero-freak!

12:39.520 --> 12:41.360
Whose fault is this?

12:43.530 --> 12:45.860
<i>But she's right. This is a chance.</i>

12:45.860 --> 12:47.950
<i>I need to get off my butt.</i>

12:48.490 --> 12:51.950
<i>I want to talk to Narukara-san.</i>

12:51.950 --> 12:53.750
<i>I want a real chance to talk with her.</i>

12:53.750 --> 12:57.210
<i>And I want to apologize.</i>

13:07.800 --> 13:09.300
<i>I love you!</i>

13:09.300 --> 13:13.770
<i>I love you, summer days!</i>

13:13.770 --> 13:18.020
<i>No matter how much time goes by,</i>

13:18.020 --> 13:20.440
<i>I'll always remember you.</i>

13:20.440 --> 13:24.440
<i>First Love Memories!</i>

13:34.450 --> 13:36.830
I can't take my eyes
off you for a second!

13:43.840 --> 13:49.220
If she isn't anywhere I've looked,
where could she be?

14:05.610 --> 14:07.820
Stay away! Stay away! Stay away!

14:10.320 --> 14:12.780
Move! Move! Move! Move!

14:26.170 --> 14:29.220
The output was just fine, too...

14:29.890 --> 14:31.760
Maybe it's the balance...

14:32.220 --> 14:34.770
Guess I'll work on the
wing design some more...

15:23.310 --> 15:26.360
<i>What is this? Some kind of nut, maybe?</i>

15:26.360 --> 15:28.530
It smells good.

15:30.200 --> 15:32.990
<i>It's kind of damp...</i>

15:36.660 --> 15:40.620
What are you doing...

15:40.620 --> 15:43.250
Um, well...

15:43.880 --> 15:45.960
I was a little hungry.

15:45.960 --> 15:48.260
And I didn't get enough sleep,
so I kind of spaced out...

15:48.260 --> 15:50.260
My reed...

15:52.130 --> 15:54.140
N-No!

15:54.640 --> 15:55.640
D...

15:55.640 --> 15:56.640
Da?

15:56.640 --> 15:59.640
Don't eat it!

16:04.650 --> 16:07.650
