16:10.780 --> 16:11.990
A dream?

16:15.870 --> 16:17.580
Is that it?

16:19.910 --> 16:21.710
Ta-dah!

16:21.710 --> 16:24.830
Go! Go, Inspiration!
Let's go, Inspiration!

16:24.830 --> 16:27.590
Fight! Fight! Yay!

16:29.420 --> 16:32.340
<i>That's right. This is where I...</i>

16:36.850 --> 16:38.600
<i>And Narukara-san...</i>

16:48.980 --> 16:52.570
<i>Wh-What am I doing, staring at her?</i>

16:53.450 --> 16:55.200
<i>This is my chance!</i>

16:55.200 --> 16:58.620
<i>I can talk to her without Raika here.</i>

16:58.620 --> 17:00.620
<i>I-It's simple, right?</i>

17:02.120 --> 17:04.500
<i>What's this feeling?</i>

17:09.250 --> 17:12.010
Wh-What am I doing?

17:12.010 --> 17:15.550
Stop! Stop it!

17:15.550 --> 17:16.890
I...

17:53.130 --> 17:54.970
Wh-What did I write?

17:54.970 --> 17:56.590
What are you doing?

17:57.720 --> 18:00.220
No, well... that's...

18:01.720 --> 18:04.810
A defenseless girl is sleeping there,
right in front of you!

18:04.810 --> 18:08.100
Go on and devour her, already!

18:08.100 --> 18:09.730
Like a hungry pig!

18:09.730 --> 18:13.320
Go on! Charge! Let out a big,
old "oink", you puberty pig!

18:14.320 --> 18:16.990
