a perverted teenager?

18:16.990 --> 18:18.450
You should be ashamed of yourself!

18:18.450 --> 18:19.570
You ****!

18:19.570 --> 18:21.070
That's what you're mad about?

18:24.700 --> 18:26.080
What is that?

18:26.080 --> 18:28.830
No, well...

18:28.830 --> 18:33.840
"If you were to give it a name, you could
call it the purest drop, the gold drop."

18:33.840 --> 18:35.840
<i>The gold drop...</i>

18:35.840 --> 18:39.840
"A lustrous jewel, made from
the life and the beauty of spring.

18:39.840 --> 18:41.850
That was..."

18:43.220 --> 18:45.100
What is this?

18:45.100 --> 18:46.600
Don't read it! Just don't read it!

18:46.600 --> 18:48.600
