18:48.600 --> 18:51.100
You should be writing about her
woman-bush or something!

18:51.100 --> 18:53.480
Or a gleaming spear of flesh!

18:53.480 --> 18:56.070
Or a pea! Stuff like that!

18:56.070 --> 18:57.900
Have you gone mad, Taketo?

18:57.900 --> 18:59.490
Just what are you even saying?

18:59.490 --> 19:03.240
Rape! Violate! Mons pubis! Repeat!
Get back to being yourself!

19:03.240 --> 19:05.080
Rape! Violate! Mons pubis! Say it!

19:05.080 --> 19:06.490
I-I'm not saying that!

19:06.490 --> 19:09.460
Rape... Violate...

19:09.460 --> 19:10.710
Mons pubis...

19:10.710 --> 19:12.540
Listen! You're...

19:21.510 --> 19:23.930
A-Again?!

19:26.390 --> 19:28.520
Narukara-san?

20:10.060 --> 20:12.810
U-U-U-Um....

20:14.310 --> 20:16.650
No!

20:16.650 --> 20:18.020
N-Narukara-san, wait...

20:29.660 --> 20:32.040
<i>I ended up with bigger problems
than that interview.</i>

20:34.790 --> 20:37.540
<i>But what was that, anyway?</i>

20:38.460 --> 20:43.090
<i>I've never felt anything like that before.
It was unlike anything else.</i>

20:43.090 --> 20:48.100
<i>It was energetic and overpowering,
but somehow clear.</i>

20:48.640 --> 20:50.060
<i>No, it was more...</i>

20:50.060 --> 20:52.600
<i>more... I don't know.</i>

20:54.140 --> 20:57.560
<i>What's the use of just
thinking about this?</i>

20:57.560 --> 21:00.360
<i>I'm an author! There is but
one thing for me to do,</i>

21:00.360 --> 21:01.150
<i>write!</i>

21:16.500 --> 21:19.250
Transforming with my magic clarinet!

21:19.710 --> 21:22.800
Purarara Purarira Pururupi!

21:23.130 --> 21:25.550
I'll never stop blowing!

21:25.550 --> 21:27.890
Magical Girl Fukune-chan!

21:27.890 --> 21:32.970
"Purarira... Pururupi..."

21:32.970 --> 21:35.560
Wh-What is this?

21:36.100 --> 21:38.810
Why am I writing a light novel?

21:38.810 --> 21:41.520
Th-This hasn't ever happened before.

21:41.520 --> 21:42.900
What hasn't?

21:43.900 --> 21:45.030
Chief!

21:45.030 --> 21:47.530
Taketo-san! Is your draft ready?

21:47.530 --> 21:49.370
Um, well...

21:49.370 --> 21:51.660
Wait. There's a reason for this.

21:51.660 --> 21:53.580
Actually, why are you
in the guy's dorms?

21:53.580 --> 21:56.410
If it's not done, that
can't be helped, I guess.

21:56.410 --> 22:01.210
I'll wait as long as it takes for you to
write me something good, Akutagawa-sensei!

22:02.670 --> 22:04.460
